      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    from math import erf, exp, log, sqrt\n\n    stock_price = 120.0\n    strike_price = 130.0\n    risk_free_rate = 0.02\n    time_to_maturity = 1.0\n    volatility = 0.35\n\n    d1 = (\n        log(stock_price / strike_price)\n        + (risk_free_rate + 0.5 * volatility ** 2) * time_to_maturity\n    ) / (volatility * sqrt(time_to_maturity))\n    d2 = d1 - volatility * sqrt(time_to_maturity)\n\n    normal_cdf = lambda x: 0.5 * (1.0 + erf(x / sqrt(2.0)))\n    call_price = (\n        stock_price * normal_cdf(d1)\n        - strike_price * exp(-risk_free_rate * time_to_maturity) * normal_cdf(d2)\n    )\n\n    return round(call_price, 2)\n```",
